{'symbol': 'AIG', 'date': '2022-11-03 16:16:00', 'title': 'AIG ANNOUNCES INDEPENDENT DIRECTOR PAOLA BERGAMASCHI ELECTED TO JOIN BOARD EFFECTIVE DECEMBER 1, 2022', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERICAN INTERNATIONAL GROUP, INC. (NYSE: AIG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS ELECTED PAOLA BERGAMASCHI AS A DIRECTOR OF THE COMPANY, EFFECTIVE DECEMBER 1, 2022.'}